BT /F1 11 Tf 50 434 Td (PO numbers, and special characters. \(4\) Standardized text to lowercase for consistent) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 420 Td (feature extraction. These steps ensure the model focuses on meaningful textual) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 406 Td (content rather than noise from formatting inconsistencies.) Tj ET
