BT /F1 11 Tf 50 157 Td (paraphrases, state-of-the-art NLP performance on large datasets) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 143 Td (* Disadvantages: Requires GPU infrastructure, prone to severe overfitting with only) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 129 Td (268 samples, slow training, computationally expensive, difficult to interpret) Tj ET
